      "writtenOn": "2023-07-28T03:00:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Generally we\u0027ve had trouble with mockito-extended, especially for code coverage configs; it does a bit too much dark magic with class bytecode, leading to weird test failures and performance problems. If possible I\u0027d stick with regular mockito (mockito-target-minus-junit4), and avoid mocking final/static methods.\n\nThen you won\u0027t need the jni_libs either",
